hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber
participant "工具执行" as Exec
participant "Tool 客户端" as ToolClient
participant "Mate 调用通道" as Channel
participant "Mate" as Mate
[-> Exec ++ : 执行工单工具
Exec -> ToolClient ++ : 执行工具（工具标识、参数、本次凭据）
